{"id":"7e4b966bb057aaf7","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion.md","title":"谱扩张推出组合边扩张","display":"thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion — 谱扩张推出组合边扩张","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion","aliases":["28-thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion"],"display":"thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion — 谱扩张推出组合边扩张","depends_on":["[[28-df-spectral-expander]]","[[28-df-edge-expander]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 21.9(1) and Lemma 21.10; printed pp.428–429; PDF pp.454–455","source_printed_pages":"428–429","source_pdf_pages":"454–455","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","proof_status":"local-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion — 谱扩张推出组合边扩张"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"df14955ee1f08cd3\" href=\"?note=df14955ee1f08cd3\" title=\"28-df-spectral-expander\">28-df-spectral-expander</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c355ffd617fb7a9d\" href=\"?note=c355ffd617fb7a9d\" title=\"28-df-edge-expander\">28-df-edge-expander</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 21.9(1) and Lemma 21.10; printed pp.428–429; PDF pp.454–455"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"428–429"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"454–455"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\">\\(G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in[0,1)\">\\(\\alpha\\in[0,1)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G;\\alpha)\">\\(\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G;\\alpha)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"df14955ee1f08cd3\" href=\"?note=df14955ee1f08cd3\" title=\"28-df-spectral-expander\">28-df-spectral-expander</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EdgeExp}\">\\(\\operatorname{EdgeExp}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_G\">\\(E_G\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c355ffd617fb7a9d\" href=\"?note=c355ffd617fb7a9d\" title=\"28-df-edge-expander\">28-df-edge-expander</a> 及其上游；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq[N]\">\\(S\\subseteq[N]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=[N]\\setminus S\">\\(T=[N]\\setminus S\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|E_G(S,T)|\\ge(1-\\alpha)\\frac{D|S||T|}{N}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|E_G(S,T)|\\ge(1-\\alpha)\\frac{D|S||T|}{N}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EdgeExp}(G;(1-\\alpha)/2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EdgeExp}(G;(1-\\alpha)/2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\varnothing\">\\(S=\\varnothing\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\varnothing\">\\(T=\\varnothing\\)</span> 两边均为0。其余情形令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z(v)=|T|\">\\(z(v)=|T|\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in S\">\\(v\\in S\\)</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z(v)=-|S|\">\\(z(v)=-|S|\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in T\">\\(v\\in T\\)</span>）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_vz(v)=0\">\\(\\sum_vz(v)=0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|z\\|_2^2=N|S||T|\">\\(\\|z\\|_2^2=N|S||T|\\)</span>。对称随机矩阵满足\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|z\\|_2^2-\\langle z,P_Gz\\rangle=\\tfrac12\\sum_{u,v}P_G(u,v)(z(u)-z(v))^2=N^2|E_G(S,T)|/D\">\\(\\|z\\|_2^2-\\langle z,P_Gz\\rangle=\\tfrac12\\sum_{u,v}P_G(u,v)(z(u)-z(v))^2=N^2|E_G(S,T)|/D\\)</span>。\n谱界给出左侧至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1-\\alpha)\\|z\\|_2^2\">\\((1-\\alpha)\\|z\\|_2^2\\)</span>，得到首式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|S|\\le N/2\">\\(|S|\\le N/2\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|T|/N\\ge1/2\">\\(|T|/N\\ge1/2\\)</span>，得到第二式。此为原书定理21.9的第1方向；没有把边扩张误当作绝对谱扩张的无条件充分条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-spectral-expander","status":"resolved","id":"df14955ee1f08cd3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-spectral-expander]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-edge-expander","status":"resolved","id":"c355ffd617fb7a9d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-edge-expander]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-spectral-expander","status":"resolved","id":"df14955ee1f08cd3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$，$\\alpha\\in[0,1)$，$\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G;\\alpha)$，见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]]。$\\operatorname{EdgeExp}$、$E_G$ 见 [[28-df-edge-expander]] 及其上游；$S\\subseteq[N]$，$T=[N]\\setminus S$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-edge-expander","status":"resolved","id":"c355ffd617fb7a9d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$，$\\alpha\\in[0,1)$，$\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G;\\alpha)$，见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]]。$\\operatorname{EdgeExp}$、$E_G$ 见 [[28-df-edge-expander]] 及其上游；$S\\subseteq[N]$，$T=[N]\\setminus S$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in[0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G;\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EdgeExp}","display":false},{"tex":"E_G","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq[N]","display":false},{"tex":"T=[N]\\setminus S","display":false},{"tex":"|E_G(S,T)|\\ge(1-\\alpha)\\frac{D|S||T|}{N}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EdgeExp}(G;(1-\\alpha)/2).","display":true},{"tex":"S=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"z(v)=|T|","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"z(v)=-|S|","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_vz(v)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\|z\\|_2^2=N|S||T|","display":false},{"tex":"\\|z\\|_2^2-\\langle z,P_Gz\\rangle=\\tfrac12\\sum_{u,v}P_G(u,v)(z(u)-z(v))^2=N^2|E_G(S,T)|/D","display":false},{"tex":"(1-\\alpha)\\|z\\|_2^2","display":false},{"tex":"|S|\\le N/2","display":false},{"tex":"|T|/N\\ge1/2","display":false}],"bytes":1565,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-266","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第21章：扩展图、游走与提取器：[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]、[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]、[[28-df-spectral-expander]]、[[28-df-edge-expander]]、[[28-df-explicit-expander-family]]、[[28-thm-random-walk-mixing]]、[[28-thm-expander-mixing-lemma]]、[[28-thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion]]、[[28-thm-lazy-walk-spectrum]]、[[28-thm-expander-walk-extractor]]。"}],"outgoing":["df14955ee1f08cd3","c355ffd617fb7a9d"]}